      <p>You warrant that all material you submit is original, factually truthful to the best of your knowledge, does not infringe on third-party intellectual property rights, and does not contain defamatory, obscene, or unlawful statements. Our editors retain complete discretion to publish, edit for length and clarity, or reject any submitted communication.</p>

