      <p>GenAlpha Magazines is published by GenAlpha News Media Group, an independent media organization funded through reader subscriptions, institutional syndication, and transparent display advertising. We operate free from sovereign wealth subsidies, political party financing, and non-disclosed corporate backing.</p>

